Don't forget telepathy (boy it sure seems like those floating eyes have
become scarce lately; they used to show up regularly on Dlvl 1 or 2,
now I often get to experience level 10 or more before I encounter one
cooperative enough to leave a corpse.  And oh, by the way, kitten, you
touch that f.e. corpse and you die, luck or no luck.  If I can't have
telepathy I'll have vengeance ...).

I find telepathy indespensable below Dlvl 10.  There are too many really
nasty critters down there, and the yellow lights really bug me.  Hmm, -
maybe they're bug lights...

I also like to dance on magic traps; one of my favorite pastimes, actually.
But don't try this without telepathy, folks.  A blessed athame, a pair
of levitation boots, and telepathy can turn a magic trap into a veritable
playground...

